      "text": "3.3.2. MICE Policy in City Level"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "20260726_ee793a2d-3b21-491e-acf2-0bffa5f48f31_9_block_007",
      "coordinates": {
        "x1": 281.0,
        "y1": 1357.0,
        "x2": 2198.0,
        "y2": 1759.0
      },
      "layout_tag": "paragraph",
      "confidence": 0.9575530290603638,
      "reading_order": 8,
      "text": "In the City Development Plan (CDP) for Varanasi 2041 that was drafted under the Capacity Building for\nUrban Development project (CBUD), the establishment of a convention centre has been proposed. The\nCBUD project was a joint partnership program between MOUD and the World Bank. In the report,\nunder the ‘Local Economic Development Sector Strategy’, the need for a Convention centre was\nmentioned, which included provision for development of indoor exhibition areas, conference halls and\naccommodation units with services, at an estimated cost of INR 250 million."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "20260726_ee793a2d-3b21-491e-acf2-0bffa5f48f31_9_block_008",
      "coordinates": {
        "x1": 285.0,
        "y1": 1837.0,
        "x2": 903.0,
        "y2": 1892.0
      },
      "layout_tag": "section-title",
      "confidence": 0.8427796363830566,
      "reading_order": 9,
      "text": "3.3.3. Varanasi City of Music"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "20260726_ee793a2d-3b21-491e-acf2-0bffa5f48f31_9_block_009",
      "coordinates": {
        "x1": 283.0,
        "y1": 1940.0,
        "x2": 2196.0,
        "y2": 2133.0
      },
      "layout_tag": "paragraph",
      "confidence": 0.9441218972206116,
      "reading_order": 10,
      "text": "The Department of Tourism, Uttar Pradesh has organized and promoted cultural events to boost tourism\nin Varanasi. The following list shows the major cultural events, including classical music and\nperformances to be held in Varanasi in 2017."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "20260726_ee793a2d-3b21-491e-acf2-0bffa5f48f31_9_block_010",
